      "content": "thanks for the warning but my doctor is actually impossible to reach on short notice and this presentation is everything for my career. i only need to take one small dose just to get through the hour, it's not like i'll be on it all the time. my asthma is basically non-existent lately anyway so it shouldn't really be an issue, right? how much do people usually take for just performance anxiety?",
